      "id": 602,
      "options": {
        "content": "### \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f How to Use This DB Explorer\n\n1. **Browse Any Table**:\n   - Use the **`$target_table`** dropdown at the top to switch between `raw_telemetry`, `posture_findings`, `security_alerts`, `v_latest_posture`, and `v_posture_summary`.\n2. **Filter by Keyword**:\n   - Type any string in **`$search_keyword`** (e.g. `shadow`, `AKIA`, `root`, `exec`) to filter rows.\n3. **Run Any Ad-Hoc SQL**:\n   - Click the **`...`** (three dots) on the scratchpad panel to the left and click **Edit**.\n   - Edit the SQL query directly and hit **Refresh** to see instant results!\n4. **Explore Mode (No Save Needed)**:\n   - Use [Grafana Explore](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22a%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22P8301CFBB4E66FEF2%22%7D%7D) for a dedicated scratchpad console with auto-completion.\n\n> **Read-Only Privilege**: Queries run with `siem_viewer` credentials, protecting against accidental writes or schema drops.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.4.2",
      "title": "DB Explorer Instructions & Tips",
      "type": "text"
    }
